{
  "_meta": {
    "doc": "Instance parameter variance policy (fold-in v2 - cute sweep).",
    "lens": "Infinity-Nikki-style material dev: dreamy pastel palettes, soft glows, iridescent hints, whimsical accents, tasteful sparkle; hero materials get restraint, utility materials get variety.",
    "grounding": "Parameter substrings must match a parameter that provably exists on the parent master (the applicator never invents names; it matches substrings against the parent's live parameter list and skips unmatched entries). Value ranges are authored here; concrete per-instance values are deterministically seeded by asset name so re-runs are idempotent.",
    "palette_authority": "MPC_Melodia_Palette (sourced from the Melodia brand palette): Melusina_Lavender, Melusina_RoseGold, Melusina_SoftWhite, Melusina_Aqua, MeluPrimary/MeluSecondary/MeluAccent.",
    "v2_additions": "ShadowDreamStrength + ShadowDreamTint on every instance whose parent exposes them; toon colour ramps (RampLow/Mid/High, LayerRamp*) assigned with cute pastel triads; bShadowDream_Active flipped ON where the parent gates it; first-matching-rule-wins enforced.",
    "specimen": "Saved/Audit/owner_instance_profiles.json holds the owner's hand-tuned instances; when it exists the applicator reports how many policy parameters coincide with the owner's vocabulary.",
    "version": 2
  },
